    "authors": "MOHAMED m.almutawa22@gmail.com (via MCP)",
    "name": "Skip 6h follow-up for greeting-only chats",
    "description": "Adds a classification step before the 6-hour idle nudge: the customer's last message is checked by AI to see if it's a genuine trip/package/booking inquiry, or just a common Bahraini daily greeting/dua/congratulation sent indiscriminately to business and personal numbers. The Telegram follow-up alert now only fires for genuine inquiries.",
